Domain: "Usage-metered event ingestion with per-tenant monthly quota and idempotent billing". Could be cross-hunk: `billing-period.ts`, `usage.ts`, tests. Domain reasoning on UTC month boundaries and Decimal. But checkout-ish billing. Avoid money? Not necessary, but not discount/checkout. Maybe "API rate limiting and quota" better.

